From: Stephen Trotter <33046718+sjtrotter@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 12:04:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] RDP: select Azure US Government AVD authentication

FreeRDP defaults the AVD OAuth authority, scope, and redirect format to
the commercial cloud. A protected profile whose gateway lives in the
public Azure US Government namespace (*.wvd.azure.us) therefore failed
authentication against login.microsoftonline.us.

When the parsed gateway host has that suffix, set the authority to
login.microsoftonline.us, the scope to the www.wvd.azure.us resource, the
redirect format to the fixed native-client redirect that this cloud
expects, and enable tenant-specific authorization. Only the public
gateway suffix and public cloud constants are used; nothing is copied
from the profile.

Tested with FreeRDP 3.30.0. The series requires FreeRDP 3.16.0 or
newer: FreeRDP_GatewayAvdScope and FreeRDP_GatewayAvdAccessAadFormat
were added in that release, and every other API used is older.

This change was prepared with AI assistance (Claude, Anthropic) and was
reviewed and tested by the author.
---
 plugins/rdp/rdp_plugin.c | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plugins/rdp/rdp_plugin.c b/plugins/rdp/rdp_plugin.c
index 8da6c8452..3c623ffa3 100644
--- a/plugins/rdp/rdp_plugin.c
+++ b/plugins/rdp/rdp_plugin.c
@@ -1766,6 +1766,25 @@ static gboolean remmina_rdp_main(RemminaProtocolWidget *gp)
 			return FALSE;
 		}
 		g_free(filtered);
+
+		const gchar *gateway = freerdp_settings_get_string(
+			rfi->clientContext.context.settings, FreeRDP_GatewayHostname);
+		if (gateway && g_str_has_suffix(gateway, ".wvd.azure.us")) {
+			if (!freerdp_settings_set_string(rfi->clientContext.context.settings,
+							 FreeRDP_GatewayAzureActiveDirectory,
+							 "login.microsoftonline.us") ||
+			    !freerdp_settings_set_string(rfi->clientContext.context.settings,
+							 FreeRDP_GatewayAvdScope,
+							 "https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wvd.azure.us%2F.default%20openid%20profile%20offline_access") ||
+			    !freerdp_settings_set_string(rfi->clientContext.context.settings,
+							 FreeRDP_GatewayAvdAccessAadFormat,
+							 "https%%3A%%2F%%2Flogin.microsoftonline.com%%2Fcommon%%2Foauth2%%2Fnativeclient") ||
+			    !freerdp_settings_set_bool(rfi->clientContext.context.settings,
+						       FreeRDP_GatewayAvdUseTenantid, TRUE)) {
+				REMMINA_PLUGIN_ERROR("Could not configure Azure US Government authentication");
+				return FALSE;
+			}
+		}
 	}
 
 	gchar* ddir = remmina_plugin_service->file_get_user_datadir();
